---
// Republic of Wilson — Landing Page
// 放置位置：src/pages/index.astro（取代或合併你現有的首頁）
// 圖片素材：請把 row-icon.png 放到專案的 public/ 資料夾根目錄
//          （放好之後，程式碼裡的 /row-icon.png 就能正確抓到圖）
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Republic of Wilson｜科技 · App · 內容</title>
<meta name="description" content="Republic of Wilson — 分享軟體操作心得，記錄獨立開發者的 App 開發進度。">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/row-icon.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#06080f; --bg-alt:#0b0f1c; --card:#0e1322; --line:rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
    --ink:#f4f5f9; --sub:#98a1b6; --gold:#e9c17e; --gold-deep:#c9974f;
    --radius:16px;
    --font: 'Poppins','Noto Sans TC','Microsoft JhengHei',-apple-system,sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    font-family:var(--font);
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--ink);
    line-height:1.75;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}
  section{padding:clamp(56px,9vw,110px) 24px;}
  .wrap{max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto;}
  .eyebrow{color:var(--gold); font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase;}
  h1,h2,h3{font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.3px;}

  /* ---------- Nav ---------- */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(6,8,15,0.75);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav{
    max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; padding:14px 24px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;}
  .brand img{width:34px; height:34px;}
  .brand span{font-weight:700; font-size:1rem; letter-spacing:1px; white-space:nowrap;}
  .nav-links{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:36px; font-size:0.92rem; color:var(--sub);}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--gold);}
  .nav-cta{
    border:1px solid var(--gold); color:var(--gold) !important;
    padding:8px 18px; border-radius:999px; font-size:0.85rem !important; font-weight:600;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover{background:var(--gold); color:var(--bg) !important;}
  .burger{display:none; flex-direction:column; gap:5px; background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; padding:6px;}
  .burger span{width:22px; height:2px; background:var(--ink); display:block; border-radius:2px;}
  .mobile-menu{
    display:none; flex-direction:column; gap:2px;
    background:var(--bg-alt); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:8px 24px 18px;
  }
  .mobile-menu a{padding:12px 4px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--ink); font-size:0.95rem;}
  .mobile-menu a:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  body.menu-open .mobile-menu{display:flex;}

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero{text-align:center; padding-top:clamp(64px,10vw,120px);}
  .hero img.mark{
    width:clamp(120px,18vw,180px); margin:0 auto 8px;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4.4vw,2.9rem);
    margin:18px auto 18px;
    max-width:760px;
  }
  .hero h1 .accent{color:var(--gold);}
  .hero p.lede{
    color:var(--sub); font-size:clamp(0.95rem,1.6vw,1.1rem);
    max-width:560px; margin:0 auto 34px;
  }
  .hero-cta{display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    padding:13px 26px; border-radius:999px; font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:600;
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:var(--gold); color:#111;}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--gold-deep);}
  .btn-ghost{border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--ink);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold); color:var(--gold);}

  /* ---------- Section head ---------- */
  .section-head{
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:space-between;
    margin-bottom:32px; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.35rem,2.6vw,1.9rem); margin-top:8px;}
  .section-head .more{font-size:0.88rem; color:var(--gold); white-space:nowrap;}

  /* ---------- Cards grid ---------- */
  .grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:22px;}
  .card{
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:26px; transition:transform .18s ease, border-color .18s ease;
  }
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px); border-color:rgba(233,193,126,0.35);}
  .card .tag{
    display:inline-block; font-size:0.72rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.5px;
    color:var(--gold); background:rgba(233,193,126,0.1); padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .card h3{font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.5;}
  .card p{color:var(--sub); font-size:0.88rem;}
  .card .meta{margin-top:16px; font-size:0.78rem; color:#6b7386;}

  /* ---------- App dev timeline ---------- */
  .appdev-box{
    background:var(--bg-alt); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px;
    padding:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);
  }
  .appdev-top{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px; margin-bottom:30px;}
  .appdev-top h3{font-size:1.3rem;}
  .appdev-top p{color:var(--sub); font-size:0.9rem; max-width:480px; margin-top:8px;}
  .status-pill{
    font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--gold);
    border:1px solid var(--gold); padding:6px 14px; border-radius:999px; white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .timeline{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; position:relative; margin-top:10px;}
  .timeline::before{
    content:''; position:absolute; top:9px; left:0; right:0; height:2px; background:var(--line);
  }
  .step{flex:1; text-align:center; position:relative; z-index:1;}
  .step .dot{
    width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--bg-alt); border:2px solid var(--sub);
    margin:0 auto 10px;
  }
  .step.done .dot{background:var(--gold); border-color:var(--gold);}
  .step.active .dot{border-color:var(--gold); box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(233,193,126,0.18);}
  .step span{font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--sub);}
  .step.active span{color:var(--gold); font-weight:600;}
  .step.done span{color:var(--ink);}

  /* ---------- About ---------- */
  .about{
    display:flex; gap:32px; align-items:center;
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px;
    padding:clamp(28px,4vw,40px); flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .avatar{
    width:76px; height:76px; border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#8a6a34);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:700; font-size:1.5rem; color:#111;
  }
  .about-text p{color:var(--sub); font-size:0.93rem; max-width:600px;}
  .about-text h3{margin-bottom:8px; font-size:1.15rem;}

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:36px 24px;}
  .footer-inner{
    max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px;
  }
  .footer-brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; color:var(--sub); font-size:0.85rem;}
  .footer-brand img{width:22px; height:22px;}
  .footer-links{display:flex; gap:22px; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--sub);}
  .footer-links a:hover{color:var(--gold);}

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  }
  @media (max-width:720px){
    .nav-links{display:none;}
    .burger{display:flex;}
    .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .about{flex-direction:column; text-align:center;}
    .appdev-top{flex-direction:column;}
    .timeline{flex-wrap:wrap; row-gap:20px;}
    .timeline::before{display:none;}
    .step{flex:0 0 33%;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <a class="brand" href="#home">
      <img src="/row-icon.png" alt="Republic of Wilson icon">
      <span>REPUBLIC OF WILSON</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="#software">軟體心得</a>
      <a href="#appdev">App 開發日誌</a>
      <a href="#about">關於</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="mailto:hi@republic-of-wilson.com">聯絡我</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="burger" id="burgerBtn" aria-label="開啟選單">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
    <a href="#software">軟體心得</a>
    <a href="#appdev">App 開發日誌</a>
    <a href="#about">關於</a>
    <a href="mailto:hi@republic-of-wilson.com">聯絡我</a>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="wrap">
    <img class="mark" src="/row-icon.png" alt="Republic of Wilson logo">
    <h1>分享科技觀察，記錄 <span class="accent">App</span> 從 0 到 1 的過程</h1>
    <p class="lede">這裡整理實測過的軟體操作心得，也公開記錄獨立開發 App 的每一步進度 —— 想法、卡關、與最終上線。</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#software">閱讀最新文章</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#appdev">查看 App 開發進度</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="software">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Software Notes</div>
        <h2>軟體心得</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="more" href="#">查看全部文章 →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="#">
        <span class="tag">工具推薦</span>
        <h3>5 個提升寫作效率的免費工具實測</h3>
        <p>整理最近實際用過、真正有幫助的線上工具清單。</p>
        <div class="meta">敬請期待</div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="#">
        <span class="tag">教學</span>
        <h3>新手也能懂：從零開始架設個人網站</h3>
        <p>網域、主機、信箱一次搞定的完整流程紀錄。</p>
        <div class="meta">敬請期待</div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="#">
        <span class="tag">開箱心得</span>
        <h3>這款軟體真的值得付費訂閱嗎？</h3>
        <p>實際使用兩週後，整理優缺點與適合對象。</p>
        <div class="meta">敬請期待</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="appdev" style="background:var(--bg-alt);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Build in Public</div>
        <h2>App 開發進度</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="appdev-box">
      <div class="appdev-top">
        <div>
          <h3>目前開發中的專案</h3>
          <p>公開記錄從企劃到上線的完整過程，包含設計決策、卡關與解決方式，之後會陸續補上實際專案細節。</p>
        </div>
        <span class="status-pill">開發中</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="step done"><div class="dot"></div><span>企劃</span></div>
        <div class="step done"><div class="dot"></div><span>設計</span></div>
        <div class="step active"><div class="dot"></div><span>開發</span></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="dot"></div><span>測試</span></div>
        <div class="step"><div class="dot"></div><span>上線</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="about">
      <div class="avatar">W</div>
      <div class="about-text">
        <h3>關於 Republic of Wilson</h3>
        <p>嗨，我是 Wilson。喜歡研究新科技工具，也正在自己動手做 App。這裡是我記錄軟體使用心得與開發歷程的地方，希望這些紀錄對你也有幫助。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <img src="/row-icon.png" alt="icon">
      <span>© 2026 Republic of Wilson</span>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="mailto:hi@republic-of-wilson.com">hi@republic-of-wilson.com</a>
      <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  const burgerBtn = document.getElementById('burgerBtn');
  burgerBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
    document.body.classList.toggle('menu-open');
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('.mobile-menu a').forEach(function (a) {
    a.addEventListener('click', function () {
      document.body.classList.remove('menu-open');
    });
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
